  "title": "Elizabeth I of England",
  "summary": "Elizabeth I, born at Greenwich on 7 September 1533, was the daughter of Henry VIII and Anne Boleyn. Queen of England and Ireland from 17 November 1558 until her death, she established an English church with herself as supreme governor, a settlement that would evolve into the Church of England. She never married, and her reign saw the defeat of the Spanish Armada in 1588. She died at Richmond Palace on 24 March 1603 and was succeeded by James VI of Scotland.",
